  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Three current-carrying wires lie in the same plane and carry currents of 6 A, 2 A and 4 A. The currents are all in the same direction.</p>\n<p>The 2 A wire is 4 cm from the 4 A wire and 6 cm from the 6 A wire.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What magnetic force per unit length acts on the 2 A wire?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">0</li><li data-label=\"B\">40 μN m<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">80 μN m<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">160 μN m<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
